# Game design doc lock

[`docs/game/game-design.md`](docs/game/game-design.md) holds Marloth Strategy’s high-level vision.

- Do **not** create, edit, or delete that file unless the **user explicitly instructed** changes to it in the current conversation.
- Put secondary design and player-facing rules in [`docs/game/features/`](docs/game/features/) (see the [features index](docs/game/features/README.md)).
- Reading the file is fine; proposing or applying unsolicited edits is not.
